1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 1 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
Yesterday, Leo was
all alone…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,400
…and then you
showed up!

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Yesterday: 1 resident.

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,500
Today? 57!

6
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,600
That brings
€56,088 into the budget!

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,900
Ecaterina, ExtTalCat and Kalina
move in with Leo!

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,700
His house is full!

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Joshua asked for
a separate house…

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,600
Here it is!

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,400
But 47 of you
still sleep in tents!

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,900
2 of you wanted
an apartment block…

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,700
Room for 120 more!

14
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,700
Yoan, Gabor and 45 more
move in!

15
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,300
Welcome Ambo, kratos, Minijr, James and Ray!

16
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,700
And what do you
want next?

17
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,100
School and police station
are tied!

18
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,600
The school costs
€120,000.

19
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,000
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

20
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,500
Who wants to be
the first principal?

21
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,900
Tell me in the
comments!
